<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; color:#000000; bEditID:r3st1; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<font face="HelveticaNeue" size="4" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt;">{!Lead.FirstName},</font><br><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12px; font-family: HelveticaNeue; text-size-adjust: auto;"><font size="4"><br></font></div><div style="font-family: HelveticaNeue; text-size-adjust: auto;"><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12px;"><span style="font-size: large;"><a href="http://memphisinvest.com" style=""><font color="#3366ff"><b>Memphis Invest</b></font></a> is pioneering the turnkey, passive real estate market. With almost 5,000 properties under management in 5 different markets, we are committed to building your portfolio the <b>RIGHT</b> way.</span></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12px;"><span style="font-size: large;"><br></span></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12px;"><span style="font-size: large;">At Memphis Invest, we work closely with you to provide an exceptional experience and are dedicated to building long-term wealth through passive investments.</span></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12px;"><span style="font-size: large;"><br></span></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12px;"><span style="font-size: large;">At this point, I have tried reaching out to you a couple times but I know your time is valuable...</span></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12px;"><span style="font-size: large;"><br></span></div><div style="font-size: 12px;"><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: large;">If you are serious about building your passive real estate portfolio,&nbsp;</span><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: large;">simply </span><font color="#3366ff"><a href="http://info.memphisinvest.com/joshua-jackson-one-to-one"><b style="font-size: large;">click here, to schedule a one on one call with me.</b><span style="font-size: large;">&nbsp;</span></a></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12px;"><span style="font-size: large;"><br></span></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font size="4">If I don't hear from you, do I have your permission to close your file?</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font size="4"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font size="4">Either way, I look forward to hearing from you!</font></div></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12px; font-family: HelveticaNeue; text-size-adjust: auto;"><br></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12px; font-family: HelveticaNeue; text-size-adjust: auto;"><font size="4"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12px; font-family: HelveticaNeue; text-size-adjust: auto;"><font size="4">Take care,</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12px; font-family: HelveticaNeue; text-size-adjust: auto;"><font size="4"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12px; font-family: HelveticaNeue; text-size-adjust: auto;"><font size="4">Joshua</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12px; font-family: HelveticaNeue; text-size-adjust: auto;"><font size="4"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12px; font-family: HelveticaNeue; text-size-adjust: auto;"><font size="4"><a href="https://my.timetrade.com/book/HFY5P "><br></a></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12px; font-family: HelveticaNeue; text-size-adjust: auto;"><font size="4"><a href="https://my.timetrade.com/book/HFY5P "><img src="https://c.na45.content.force.com/servlet/servlet.ImageServer?id=0153A000003nQ3c&amp;oid=00D30000000pfXl" border="0" align="left" alt=""><br></a></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12px; font-family: HelveticaNeue; text-size-adjust: auto;"><a href="https://my.timetrade.com/book/HFY5P "><br></a></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12px; font-family: HelveticaNeue; text-size-adjust: auto;"><a href="https://my.timetrade.com/book/HFY5P "><br></a></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0,